### Goal Model Tables

#### **Goals Table**
| Goal ID | Goal Title                 | Text                                                                 | Runtime Annotation                          | Goal Type  | Relation |
|---------|----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|------------|----------|
| G1      | Complete Resource Delivery Mission | Ensure all requested resources are collected from storage and delivered to the destination. | -                                           | Achieve    | -        |
| G2      | Collect Resources from Storage | Retrieve required resources from storage locations in an optimized order. | `FALLBACK(G2.1, G2.2)`                     | Perform    | G1       |
| G3      | Deliver Resources to Destination | Transport collected resources to the specified location.                | `FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2)`                     | Perform    | G1       |
| G2.1    | Collect From All Storages   | Retrieve resources from all required storage locations in parallel.   | `#`                                         | Perform    | G2       |
| G2.2    | Handle Low Battery in Collection | Recharge the robot and assign remaining collection tasks to another robot. | -                                           | Perform    | G2       |
| G3.1    | Deliver Resources Sequentially | Transport resources to the destination in sequential trips if needed. | `;`                                         | Perform    | G3       |
| G3.2    | Handle Low Battery in Delivery | Return resources to a checkpoint and assign remaining delivery tasks to another robot. | -                                           | Perform    | G3       |

